  "sourceTitle": "Italian Pasta Salad",
  "sourceText": "Italian Pasta Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, February 17, 2010 - 10:56pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n16 ounces shell pasta, cooked and drained\n16 ounces Italian salad dressing\n1 cup chopped green bell pepper\n1 cup sliced black olives, pitted\n1 cup sliced pepperoni\n1/2 cup grated parmesan cheese\n2 teaspoons dried oregano\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients and refrigerate until serving.\n\nAbout\n\n\nPasta salad with an Italian feel. Very simple to make but big flavor.",
